


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_fe776d95:


    "——放学后。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_e5b5903f:


    "现在在教室里的只有伦和文两人。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_9cbba346:


    "平时的话，都会等阳菜和圣夜子回来，然后大家一起去趟超市再回宿舍的。然而现在得和要回家一段时间的文在教室这里道别了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_4d5c4479:



    voice "2RI_1591"
    rin "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_190d4681:


    "本应是目送文离开的但却在不经意间拉住了她的手。为此连伦自己都被自己的这一举动而吓到发出声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_7a5c718f:



    voice "2FU_1186"
    fumi "「——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_00d449f7:


    "当然文也被吓得转过来头。在瞄了一下挂钟后对伦露出了微笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_a711f36a:



    voice "2FU_1187"
    fumi "「再待一会儿吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_24c95265:



    voice "2RI_1592"
    rin "「嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_8751e154:


    "伦的表情瞬间缓和了不少。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_6b2d38d5:



    voice "2FU_1188"
    fumi "「早上能起得来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_a2f5f6b4:



    voice "2RI_1593"
    rin "「我每天都有到学校吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_4baa65fb:



    voice "2FU_1189"
    fumi "「嗯嗯。真棒」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_cc557a52:


    "文稍微踮起脚尖然后摸了摸伦的头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_05b248ec:



    voice "2FU_1190"
    fumi "「晚饭呢？没有挑食吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_486b2a21:



    voice "2RI_1594"
    rin "「嗯。要是剩下菜的话阳菜要发火了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_f5dcb73a:



    voice "2FU_1191"
    fumi "「啊哈哈。夏目同学真能干呢。那你有用熨斗熨上衣——！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_fda578d3:


    "打断了文说话的伦将文紧紧抱住，并向她的双唇吻去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_a1b8d63b:


    "起初也是被吓到的文，马上就接纳了伦并轻轻地来回抚摸着伦的后背。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_05416423:



    voice "2RI_1595"
    rin "「呀！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_9c8429fe:


    "在漫长的拥吻之后，伦猛地抽离了身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_c95ddbc7:



    voice "2RI_1596"
    rin "「我一个人也没问题的！衣服也有好好地熨过」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_f43376ce:


    "伦挺起了胸膛。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_0db8dffb:



    voice "2FU_1192"
    fumi "「……太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_2d2111a7:


    "当然文也察觉到了这其实是伦在逞强。但还是回以微笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_8c53e716:



    voice "2RI_1597"
    rin "「碗我洗了，衣服也洗好晾好叠好，也给房间打扫卫生，床铺也有整理好」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_bdb73e14:


    "伦把在文不在的期间里所做的家务给逐一罗列出来。就像个渴望表扬的孩子一样。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_e3fc7f0c:



    voice "2FU_1193"
    fumi "「这不是挺厉害的嘛，伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_35f9a936:


    "文自己也因为伦这副可爱的模样而感到胸口一阵闷紧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_8261e69f:



    voice "2RI_1598"
    rin "「对了，我还给文的布偶们保养了一下哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_805da85f:



    voice "2FU_1194"
    fumi "「诶，连米卡她们你都有照顾好吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_4fb3e84d:



    voice "2RI_1599"
    rin "「不过可能没有文做得那么好就是了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_382bab2f:



    voice "2FU_1195"
    fumi "「没事的。只要伦愿意去摸摸她们就足够了，想必她们也会很开心的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_9fd86462:



    voice "2RI_1600"
    rin "「还有升学志愿表我也好好交上去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_0b850bee:



    voice "2FU_1196"
    fumi "「选的哪边呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_3376ecca:



    voice "2RI_1601"
    rin "「总之先选文科了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_4841d18f:



    voice "2FU_1197"
    fumi "「是因为要迎合我吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_dc909855:



    voice "2RI_1602"
    rin "「那也是其中一个原因。还有是因为摸底考试时我文科的分数要稍微高一点」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_6a4b387f:



    voice "2FU_1198"
    fumi "「这样吗。那将来的社会志愿呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_fe868fb1:



    voice "2RI_1603"
    rin "「那个我也交上去了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_97cd16cf:



    voice "2FU_1199"
    fumi "「怎么写的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_aaa637c5:



    voice "2RI_1604"
    rin "「……保密」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_5498a95b:



    voice "2FU_1200"
    fumi "「咦？这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_ff64b3b1:



    voice "2RI_1605"
    rin "「嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_3b571cb3:


    "伦点了点头然后腼腆地笑了下。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_2a6229f8:



    voice "2FU_1201"
    fumi "「那就期待你哪天能告诉我了哦。很高兴你能好好地考虑过未来的事」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_ed85f8d0:



    voice "2FU_1202"
    fumi "「话说，试镜的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_1930f32b:


    "校铃声响了起来，两人望了望挂钟。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_40a39a12:



    voice "2RI_1606"
    rin "「啊，抱歉。不小心挽留你这么久。一路走好哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_33dd6f79:


    "伦竭尽全力地挤出了微笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_c1b0a6ae:



    voice "2FU_1203"
    fumi "「嗯，没关系。那我先走了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_6125589c:


    "文重新提了提书包，然后三步一回头五步一挥手地离开了教室。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_a32a4624:



    voice "2RI_1607"
    rin "「不要走……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_4a92a601:


    "伦硬是把将要说出的话咽了下去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_32ea6b10:


    "——了不起哦，我来代替文摸摸你的头吧。"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_06_2bb28015:


    "——放学后。"
